---
title: Railfence cipher
tags: tools
heading: "Rail fence cipher"
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
        <p class="px-2">
            Also known as the Zig Zag cipher, takes its name from the way in which the encryption is performed - in analogy to a fence built with horizontal rails. Below is an example using 3 rails, more rails equals more complexity and makes it harder to decode without the correct number of rails.
            There is more information available on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rail_fence_cipher" class="text-convrtr">Rail fence cipher</a> Wikipedia page. 
        </p>
        <p class="px-2" data-pagefind-ignore="all">
            <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 my-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
                WE ARE DISCOVERED. RUN AT ONCE.
            </code>
            <code class="d-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2" style="
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        ">
W . . . E . . . C . . . R . . . U . . . O . . . 
. E . R . D . S . O . E . E . R . N . T . N . E 
. . A . . . I . . . V . . . D . . . A . . . C . 
            </code>
            <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 my-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
                WECRUO ERDSOEERNTNE AIVDAC
            </code>
        </p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Rail fence cipher", placeholder = "Example: HELLO WORLD &srarr; 2 [rails] &srarr; HLOOLELWRD") %}
<div class="input-group w-auto">
    <label class="input-group-text" for="{{ filename }}Amount"><span class="visually-hidden">Number of </span>Rails</label>
    <input type="number" class="form-control" id="{{ filename }}Amount" autocomplete="off" min="2" value="2" aria-describedby="{{ filename }}Status">
    <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Encrypt" aria-pressed="true">Encrypt</button>
    <button class="btn btn-outline-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Decrypt" aria-pressed="false">Decrypt</button>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
